  "remarks": "LLC SDB “Piranya” is a Russia-based company that manufactures drones used by Russia in its war of aggression against Ukraine. LLC SDB “Piranya” manufactures First Person View (FPV) drones and specifically the models “Piranya-7”, “Piranya-10” and “Piranya-13”. The company manufactures up to 10 000 drones per month and the Russian Army views its products as being extremely valuable in its military operations.",
